      "name": "Nijo Market",
      "description": "Covered market in central Sapporo known as 'Sapporo's kitchen', with stalls selling fresh seafood — crab, sea urchin and salmon roe — as well as fruit and souvenirs. Several shops serve seafood bowls (kaisen-don), making it a popular breakfast stop.",
      "highlights": ["Food", "Market"]
    },
    "ja": {
      "name": "二条市場",
      "description": "札幌中心部の市場。「札幌の台所」と呼ばれ、カニやウニ、イクラなどの海産物や果物を扱う店が並ぶ。海鮮丼を出す飲食店もあり、朝食やお土産選びに人気。",
      "highlights": ["グルメ", "市場"]
    }
  },
